# LRV Broadcast Calendar Spec

## Stack
React 19, Vite, Tailwind v4, Redux Toolkit, React Router. Mock APIs only.

## State Management (Redux)

Use Redux for all LRV screen state. Do NOT add useState in LrvPage for events/selection/modal.

```
src/store/
  index.js           — configureStore
  hooks.js           — useAppDispatch, useAppSelector
  slices/eventsSlice.js  — present/past/future undo stacks
  slices/uiSlice.js      — selection, modal, zoom, quarters, tooltip
  slices/appSlice.js     — dayParts, legend
  thunks/eventThunks.js  — async event CRUD + loadEventsForQuarters
```

Event changes MUST use `applyChange` (via thunks) to preserve undo/redo.

## Implemented Features

### Layout
- LrvHeader: logos, Food dropdown, Help, Bell, Export
- LrvToolbar: LRV_Grid, undo/redo (disabled when empty), day part, tooltip toggle, session count
- LrvFooter: Hours Count legend

### Calendar Grid
- Sticky scroll-synced CalendarHeader (quarter/month/week)
- 7 day rows, 30-min slots, horizontal scroll
- Zoom +/- bottom-right (75%–175%)
- Lazy load next quarter on scroll right; show `ScrollLoadingIndicator` with year label

### Events
- EventBlock: title bar + per-week episode cells
- Drag move, resize width/height
- ConflictOverlay: pink/blue hatch (seed data demo only)
- 800 conflict-free bulk events + 10 seed events

### Interactions
- Pointer-based cell drag selection (`useGridSelection` + rAF)
- SelectionActionBar → Create Event modal
- Right-click: Copy, Paste, Add to Grid, Move to Bin, Delete
- Tooltip at click position (toggleable)
- Double-click cell or event → modal

### Collaboration
- `useSessionPresence`: localStorage tab sessions, heartbeat 3s
- Toolbar shows "N sessions active" + avatars
- Peer cell highlights from other tabs

## API Conventions

- `fetchBroadcastEvents(dayPartId, quarters)` — quarter-filtered
- `fetchQuarterWeeks('1Q28')` — any NQYY format
- Bulk: `generateBulkBroadcastEvents(800)` — single-week, no conflicts
- Field docs: `docs/spec/API-FIELDS.md`

## Grid Constants

Defined in `src/utils/broadcastCalendar.js`:
`WEEK_COL_WIDTH=72`, `SLOT_HEIGHT=22`, `EVENT_MIN_DISPLAY_HEIGHT=40`

## Do Not

- Add toast-ui calendar (removed; React 19 incompatible)
- Load all 800+ events without quarter filter
- Store events in component useState (use Redux)
- Create multi-week bulk events that share day+time lanes (causes conflicts)

